msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to find the maximum independent set of a graph using the [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), a constrained combinatorial optimization problem.\n"
"An instance from the QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) benchmark library is formulated as a binary linear program and passed to the Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"The optimizer handles all reformulation, circuit synthesis, transpilation, and iterative warm starting internally (see [\\[3\\]](#references) for details).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial ini menunjukkan cara mencari set bebas maksimum (maximum independent set) bagi suatu graf menggunakan [Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/guides/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) [\\[1\\]](#references), iaitu masalah pengoptimuman kombinatorik terkekang.\n"
"Satu contoh daripada perpustakaan penanda aras QOBLIB [\\[2\\]](#references) dirumuskan sebagai program linear binari dan dihantar kepada Optimizer Application Function.\n"
"Optimizer ini mengendalikan semua perumusan semula, sintesis litar, transpilation, dan warm-starting berulang secara dalaman (lihat [\\[3\\]](#references) untuk butiran).\n"

